Source: plr
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), r-base-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/postgres-plr/plr

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-plr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, r-base-core
Description: R procedural language for PostgreSQL
 PL/R allows PostgreSQL functions to execute R code.
